    "body": "<details><summary>AI feedback</summary>\n\nProposed fix for defect D1 isn't applied yet.\n\nD1: Both WPTs cited in the PR description (`nav2-test-navigation-type-reload.html` and `nav2-test-navigation-type-backforward.html`) request nonexistent `resources/blank_page_*.html` URLs (returning wptserve 404 JSON responses) instead of `resources/blank-page-*.html`, leaving `200` `text/html` reload/back-forward, top-level non-BFCached `back_forward` repopulation, `srcdoc`, `blob:`/`data:`, and preserved `targetSnapshotParams` untested.\nNot applied: [proposed fix](https://github.com/noamr/wpt/commit/70b2690)\n\n<details><summary>Reviewed commits</summary>\n\nReviewed at b7da2d3 on 0e292f4, with web-platform-tests/wpt@5fd1a86, using spec-pr-review.\n</details>\n</details>\n",
