    "body": "@noamr I have now added the missing coverage in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/65674: top-level non-BFCache repopulation, `srcdoc`, `blob:`/`data:`, and preserved sandboxing flags. The sandbox test checks the child document's `document.domain` restriction directly, avoiding dependence on the caller of `window.open()`.\n\nOn c8ed48f, all five new tests pass in Chrome and Firefox, including 10 stability repetitions in each. Safari passes four; the remaining failure is that the initial `srcdoc` document has no navigation timing entry. That assertion remains intact. I have also updated this PR's test link.",
